# High-Level Operational Workflow

```
Mission Creation
        │
        ▼
Environment Builder
        │
        ▼
Mission Designer
        │
        ▼
Fleet Configuration
        │
        ▼
Mission Library / Scheduler
        │
        ▼
Deployment Review
        │
        ▼
Mission Control
        │
        ▼
Replay / Analytics / History
```

Every stage produces information consumed by the next stage.

No stage directly modifies later execution systems.

