# Architectural Scope

Phase 10D introduces seven new functional modules.

## 1. Mission Creation

Purpose

Create a reusable mission project.

Responsibilities

* Create mission metadata
* Import field data
* Import imagery
* Create mission workspace
* Persist editable mission

Outputs

Mission definition only.

This module never generates routes.

---

## 2. Environment Builder

Purpose

Transform imported geographic information into an operational environment.

Responsibilities

* Display imported imagery
* Display orthomosaics
* Display GeoTIFF layers
* Display field boundaries
* Draw agricultural zones
* Draw obstacles
* Draw restricted areas
* Draw infrastructure
* Place stations
* Create operational annotations

Outputs

Operational environment model.

No mission planning occurs here.

---

## 3. Mission Designer

Purpose

Define how the mission should be executed.

Responsibilities

Operator defines:

* Mission objectives
* Target zones
* Working order
* Coverage preferences
* Planning mode
* Flight parameters
* Operational constraints

Planning Modes

* Manual
* Assisted
* Automatic

The operator defines intent.

The backend performs planning.

---

## 4. Fleet Configuration

Purpose

Associate available resources with the mission.

Responsibilities

Select:

* Drones
* Stations
* Tanks
* Payloads
* Products
* Batteries

Display

* Capacity
* Remaining resources
* Compatibility
* Availability

Fleet Configuration never performs allocation.

It only defines available assets.

---

## 5. Mission Library

Purpose

Persist reusable mission templates.

Responsibilities

* Save mission
* Duplicate mission
* Version mission
* Import mission
* Export mission
* Organize mission library

Mission Library stores mission definitions.

It never executes missions.

---

## 6. Mission Scheduler

Purpose

Schedule future mission execution.

Responsibilities

* Calendar view
* One-time schedules
* Recurring schedules
* Queue management
* Activation time

Scheduler submits execution requests.

Scheduler never controls execution.

---

## 7. Deployment Review

Purpose

Provide the final verification step before execution.

Responsibilities

Summarize

* Geometry
* Fleet
* Products
* Stations
* Estimated duration
* Estimated coverage
* Estimated resource usage
* Mission warnings

The operator reviews.

The operator confirms.

Deployment Review never performs optimization.

